,"needsAuthMcpServers":["claude.ai Box","claude.ai Excalidraw","claude.ai Supabase"],"failedMcpServers":[],"surfacedNames":["mcp__claude_ai_Claude_Docs__batch","mcp__claude_ai_Claude_Docs__guide","mcp__claude_ai_Claude_Docs__update","mcp__claude_ai_Firecrawl__firecrawl_scrape","mcp__claude_ai_Firecrawl__firecrawl_search"]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"a322f9c8-7fc7-4d60-b6a6-bf3fbf6018b5","timestamp":"2026-10-01T11:03:57.219Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nThe following tools just became available and are ready to use:\nmcp__claude_ai_Claude_Docs__batch\nmcp__claude_ai_Claude_Docs__guide\nmcp__claude_ai_Claude_Docs__update\nmcp__claude_ai_Firecrawl__firecrawl_scrape\nmcp__claude_ai_Firecrawl__firecrawl_search\n\nThe following deferred tools are now available via ToolSearch. Their schemas are NOT loaded — calling them directly will fail with InputValidationError. Use ToolSearch with query \"select:<name>[,<name>...]\" to load tool schemas before calling them:\nCronCreate\nCronDelete\nCronList\nDesignSync\nEnterWorktree\nExitWorktree\nListMcpResourcesTool\nMonitor\nNotebookEdit\nPushNotification\nReadMcpResourceDirTool\nReadMcpResourceTool\nRemoteTrigger\nSendMessage\nTaskOutput\nTaskStop\nWebFetch\nWebSearch\nmcp__claude_ai_Claude_Docs__create\nmcp__claude_ai_Claude_Docs__delete\nmcp__claude_ai_Claude_Docs__export\nmcp__claude_ai_Claude_Docs__query\nmcp__claude_ai_Claude_Docs__read\nmcp__claude_ai_Firecrawl__firecrawl_developer_search\nmcp__claude_ai_Firecrawl__firecrawl_find_tools\nmcp__claude_ai_Firecrawl__firecrawl_research_inspect_paper\nmcp__claude_ai_Firecrawl__firecrawl_research_read_paper\nmcp__claude_ai_Firecrawl__firecrawl_research_related_papers\nmcp__claude_ai_Firecrawl__firecrawl_research_search_papers\nmcp__claude_ai_Fireflies__fireflies_create_soundbite\nmcp__claude_ai_Fireflies__fireflies_fetch\nmcp__claude_ai_Fireflies__fireflies_get_active_meetings\nmcp__claude_ai_Fireflies__fireflies_get_analytics\nmcp__claude_ai_Fireflies__fireflies_ge